# Vault Encryption Architecture

Implement envelope encryption.

## Recommended Flow

File Data
↓
AES-256-GCM File Encryption Key (FEK)
↓
FEK Wrapped by Vault Master Key (VMK)
↓
VMK Protected Using ML-KEM-1024
↓
Recovery Key Protects Backup Copy of VMK
↓
Store Encrypted Vault Locally

Benefits:

* Fast encryption for large files
* Quantum-resistant key protection
* Recovery support
* Crypto-agility
* Enterprise-grade design

